# Copy to apps/web/.env.local for local overrides. Never commit the real file.

# Where the API lives. Left unset, the app calls /api on its own origin, which
# is what the Vite dev proxy serves.
#
# This MUST be set for any deployed build. Cloudflare hosts the static app only
# — there is no API behind /api there, and the SPA fallback would answer every
# API call with index.html.
VITE_API_URL=
